    this way, using degrees for ease of representation:

    >>> rng = np.random.default_rng(0)
    >>> theta = rng.integers(0, 90, size=(20,)).cumsum()
    >>> theta
    array([ 76, 133, 179, 203, 230, 233, 239, 240, 255, 328, 386, 468, 513,
